@startuml
!include puml-style.iuml
hide empty description
left to right direction
[*] --> Unavailable
Unavailable --> Idle : components found
Idle --> Armed : trace enabled
Armed --> Idle : trace disabled
Armed --> Capturing : processor resumes
Capturing --> Armed : processor halts,\nbuffer drained,\ncapture boundary emitted
Capturing --> Idle : reset,\npipeline torn down,\nrecord discarded
Armed --> Idle : reset,\npipeline torn down
@enduml
